              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, thrusting spear, and large shield. May have light armour +2 pts. Form in Trained Phalanx formation. May be Drilled +2 pts. (Alexander the Great p.80)</characteristic>
